      "imageRatio": "40",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
      "alt": "TQMa8MxNL Embedded Cortex®-A53 module",
      "text": "<h1>Based on i.MX8M Nano with enhanced Audio properties</h1>\n<p>The TQMa8MxNL Embedded Module, featuring an embedded Cortex-A53 processor based on the i.MX8M Nano from NXP, is designed to meet the demands of embedded computing engineers. This module stands out with its advanced audio properties, integrated Cortex-M7 processor, and support for high-speed communication via 1x Gbit Ethernet and 1x USB 2.0 interface. With low power consumption and integrated security functions, it's well-suited for a variety of applications. The CPU variants, including Lite versions with reduced graphics performance, provide flexibility and performance choices for engineers.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 01 2026 03:06:47 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
      "isDecorative": "false",
